line	<str>Go north, following the path along the lake westward.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the mud on the tall tree then climb it. You do *not* need to do this again for subsequent climbs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your pole or staff on the clump of rocks to pole vault over.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your plank on the flat stones. Keep this throughout the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Listen to the shining pool.</str>
