line	<str>Take the path north, past the guard, and use your rope on a boulder you can push to get around.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head into the camp and talk to Hamal the Chieftain. (or with The Fremennik Trials completed)</str>
line	
line	<str>Dig some mud from the mud pond south of Hamal's house.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north, following the path along the lake westward.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the mud on the tall tree then climb it. You do *not* need to do this again for subsequent climbs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your pole or staff on the clump of rocks to pole vault over.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your plank on the flat stones. Keep this throughout the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Listen to the shining pool.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your plank on the flat stone to return to shore.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Hamal the Chieftain about the people of Rellekka.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Jokul north of the Cheiftains tent before leaving the camp to speak to Svidi.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search for Svidi between Rellekka and the entrance to Keldagrim.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Rellekka and talk to Brundt the Chieftain in the longhall. or if Lunar Diplomacy started/completed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the Mountain Camp, and enter the large tent south-west of Hamal the Chieftain.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your pickaxe on the Ancient Rock located in the southern tent to get half a rock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take this back to Rellekka, and talk to Brundt the Chieftain or if Lunar Diplomacy started/completed, who will give you the guarantee of safe passage.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the guarantee to Svidi. You do not need to check on Svidi afterward.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to Hamal the Chieftain.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Hamal the Chieftan again, this time about food supplies.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Jokul just north of Hamal. If you spoke to him earlier you do not need to do this. He will tell you of a White Pearl plant that is very hardy.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to White Wolf Mountain (Gnome glider if The Grand Tree completed, or Keldagrim minecart system if The Giant Dwarf is completed.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip gloves and pick-from the thorny bushes by the gnome glider.</str>
line	
line	<str>Eat the white pearl you picked to get the white pearl seed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Hamal the Chieftain to give him the white pearl seed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to the shining pool again (remember to use the pole/staff and plank).</str>
line	
line	<str>Cross the gap back to shore</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the northern path east to a cave.</str>
line	
line	<str>Chop down the trees blocking your path (make sure you are facing east)</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the cave</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>The Kendal</col>.</col>
